data: {"type":"response.output_text.done","sequence_number":901,"item_id":"msg_06d82b14f5f4370b016b00e9a8c6fc87d1bec98fc85b0cd708","output_index":1,"content_index":0,"text":"{\n  \"reviews\": [\n    {\n      \"actor\": \"sol\",\n      \"decision\": \"develop\",\n      \"ability\": null,\n      \"reason\": \"Eating already applies real food effects, but it does not provide measured sampling, structured examination or evidence-qualified personal records. Those functions warrant development. Your current health permits assessment, and an owned root is available; its current condition must be checked at execution. Neither examination nor a small uneventful sample can establish that a food is generally safe.\",\n      \"specification\": \"Implement food-assessment@1 through the current handoff, depending on inventory, metabolism, perception, event history and personal memory. Public interface assess-food has schema {target:string, mode:'examine'|'sample', fraction?:number}, additionalProperties:false; target identifies an owned stack, and sample requires fraction in [0.1,1], measured in resource units. Learning takes 3 rounds for sampling discipline and evidence interpretation, separately from implementation and use. Require living actor, health>=80, sufficient unspoiled-or-spoiled actual target quantity, stationary attention and 0.5 energy per work round; sample mode additionally requires satiety<=90 so nourishment is potentially observable. Examination takes two rounds and records only perceptible appearance, texture, odor and visible deterioration supported by implemented sensory properties; absent sensory support is recorded as unknown, never inferred from hidden nutrition/toxicity. Sample mode then consumes the specified fraction in round three through the existing food-effect resolver, charging 1 additional energy and applying proportional actual nutrition, toxicity and spoilage effects, followed by two stationary monitoring rounds at 0.5 energy each. Metabolism continues throughout. Persist operation ID, phase, target provenance, measured quantity, timestamps, sensory observations, baseline/follow-up vitals, relevant concurrent events and ingestion status. Record experienced changes with confounders; do not expose hidden composition, infer immunity, declare safety, or attribute unrelated changes to food. Reserve the sample at start using a unique escrow identity; it continues aging. Movement, incompatible action, insufficient energy, target invalidation or death cancels. Return unconsumed escrow once to inventory if alive, otherwise to the ordinary corpse/drop location; consumed material is never restored. Preserve completed observations after cancellation. Fractional inventory accounting must conserve mass and provenance: migrate integer quantities losslessly to fixed-point tenths, keep existing integer-quantity interfaces compatible, and leave remaining fractional portions accessible to assess-food. No stock is created. Owned-item interaction requires no remote world reach; use the actor's actual position and existing collision geometry, without moving objects or adding obstacles. Emit food-assessment-started, food-assessment-observed, food-assessment-sampled, food-assessment-completed and food-assessment-cancelled, with operation ID, participant, timestamps, provenance and public evidence; subscribe explicitly to died, moved, spoiled and injured for cancellation or evidence qualification. Add versioned bounded personal records, deduplicated by operation ID, with retention limits under shared state/work budgets. Migrate existing actors with empty assessment records and no active operations or retroactive awards.\",\n      \"experienceReview\": \"Examination can produce useful evidence but is not inherently enjoyable, and a harmful sample receives no mental award. Register cautious-food-relief on food-assessment-completed for the testing actor only: require completed sampling and monitoring, a genuinely new observation within that operation of experienced nourishment, no sample-associated injury or adverse symptoms, and no confounding food ingestion during the operation. The experience is modest relief from resolving a specific uncertainty, not proof of safety. Award 1 mental point, cap 1, lasting 6 rounds, with a 12-round cooldown; repeated qualifying assessments may refresh only after cooldown and never stack. Deduplicate this functional source across aliases. Application, learning, examination alone, labels and completion without qualifying evidence award nothing. Physical nutrition and harm remain independent and use actual state.\",\n      \"visualReview\": \"Show stationary examination, a measured portion only when actually reserved or consumed, and monitoring progress tied to operation phases. Display dated evidence cards separating observed appearance, measured intake, experienced changes and unresolved uncertainty; never show a safe/unsafe badge or hidden toxicity value. Bind progress and cancellation to the declared assessment events, render only actor-visible information, and remove the active indicator on cancellation or death without deleting retained evidence.\",\n      \"learning\": 3\n    }\n  ]\n}","logprobs":[]}

